Files adapted from Astro Theme Pure have been modified for Halo 2 template,
data-source, routing, and plugin compatibility.

This product uses the project structure of Halo Theme Astro Starter
(https://github.com/halo-sigs/theme-astro-starter).

The upstream project loads the Satoshi font from Fontshare. Satoshi is
governed by the ITF Free Font License, which does not permit this project to
redistribute the font files in a Halo theme archive. This product therefore
does not bundle Satoshi.

This product bundles IBM Plex Sans 1.1.0, Copyright IBM Corp., licensed under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The complete license is included at
templates/assets/pure/vendor/LICENSE-ibm-plex in the theme archive.

This product bundles medium-zoom 1.1.0
(https://github.com/francoischalifour/medium-zoom) and QRCode.js 1.0.0
(https://github.com/davidshimjs/qrcodejs), both licensed under the MIT
License, to provide the same article interactions used by Astro Theme Pure
without a runtime CDN dependency.
